{"seq":2,"slug":"otel-collector-pipeline","title":"OTel Collector 管道编排：Receiver-Processor-Exporter","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-tracing/implementation/otel-collector-pipeline","wordCount":892,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"otel-collector-管道编排-receiver-processor-exporter\">OTel Collector 管道编排：Receiver-Processor-Exporter</h1><p>OpenTelemetry Collector 是追踪数据从 SDK 到存储后端之间的关键中间层。它不仅仅是一个代理转发器——通过灵活的管道编排，Collector 承担了协议转换、数据治理、采样决策、路由分发和缓冲保护等核心职责。在生产级追踪系统中，Collector 的配置质量直接决定了数据的可靠性、成本效率和运维灵活性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Collector 采用管道（Pipeline）模型，每条管道由 Receiver、Processor 和 Exporter 三类组件顺序连接：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Receivers[&quot;Receivers (接收)&quot;]&#10;        R1[&quot;OTLP gRPC&lt;br/&gt;:4317&quot;]&#10;        R2[&quot;OTLP HTTP&lt;br/&gt;:4318&quot;]&#10;        R3[&quot;Jaeger&lt;br/&gt;:14250&quot;]&#10;        R4[&quot;Zipkin&lt;br/&gt;:9411&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Processors[&quot;Processors (处理)&quot;]&#10;        P1[&quot;batch&lt;br/&gt;批量聚合&quot;]&#10;        P2[&quot;memory_limiter&lt;br/&gt;内存保护&quot;]&#10;        P3[&quot;attributes&lt;br/&gt;属性修改&quot;]&#10;        P4[&quot;tail_sampling&lt;br/&gt;尾采样&quot;]&#10;        P5[&quot;filter&lt;br/&gt;过滤&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Exporters[&quot;Exporters (导出)&quot;]&#10;        E1[&quot;OTLP gRPC&lt;br/&gt;→ Tempo&quot;]&#10;        E2[&quot;OTLP HTTP&lt;br/&gt;→ Datadog&quot;]&#10;        E3[&quot;Debug&lt;br/&gt;→ stdout&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    R1 --&gt; P2&#10;    R2 --&gt; P2&#10;    R3 --&gt; P2&#10;    R4 --&gt; P2&#10;    P2 --&gt; P1&#10;    P1 --&gt; P3&#10;    P3 --&gt; E1&#10;    P3 --&gt; E2&#10;    P3 --&gt; E3\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Receivers[\"Receivers (接收)\"]\n        R1[\"OTLP gRPC&lt;br/&gt;:4317\"]\n        R2[\"OTLP HTTP&lt;br/&gt;:4318\"]\n        R3[\"Jaeger&lt;br/&gt;:14250\"]\n        R4[\"Zipkin&lt;br/&gt;:9411\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Processors[\"Processors (处理)\"]\n        P1[\"batch&lt;br/&gt;批量聚合\"]\n        P2[\"memory_limiter&lt;br/&gt;内存保护\"]\n        P3[\"attributes&lt;br/&gt;属性修改\"]\n        P4[\"tail_sampling&lt;br/&gt;尾采样\"]\n        P5[\"filter&lt;br/&gt;过滤\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Exporters[\"Exporters (导出)\"]\n        E1[\"OTLP gRPC&lt;br/&gt;→ Tempo\"]\n        E2[\"OTLP HTTP&lt;br/&gt;→ Datadog\"]\n        E3[\"Debug&lt;br/&gt;→ stdout\"]\n    end\n    R1 --&gt; P2\n    R2 --&gt; P2\n    R3 --&gt; P2\n    R4 --&gt; P2\n    P2 --&gt; P1\n    P1 --&gt; P3\n    P3 --&gt; E1\n    P3 --&gt; E2\n    P3 --&gt; E3</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件类型</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>数量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Receiver</td>\n<td>接收遥测数据，支持多种协议并行</td>\n<td>1+ per pipeline</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Processor</td>\n<td>按顺序处理数据（修改/过滤/采样/批量）</td>\n<td>0+ per pipeline</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Exporter</td>\n<td>将处理后的数据发送到目标后端</td>\n<td>1+ per pipeline</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Connector</td>\n<td>连接两条管道，输出一条管道的数据作为另一条的输入</td>\n<td>0+</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"核心-receiver-详解\">核心 Receiver 详解</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Receiver</th>\n<th>监听端口</th>\n<th>接受格式</th>\n<th>典型来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>otlp</code></td>\n<td>4317 (gRPC), 4318 (HTTP)</td>\n<td>OTLP Protobuf/JSON</td>\n<td>OTel SDK、其他 Collector</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>jaeger</code></td>\n<td>14250 (gRPC), 14268 (HTTP)</td>\n<td>Jaeger Thrift</td>\n<td>遗留 Jaeger Agent</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>zipkin</code></td>\n<td>9411</td>\n<td>Zipkin JSON/Thrift</td>\n<td>Zipkin 插桩服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>kafka</code></td>\n<td>N/A</td>\n<td>OTLP/Jaeger/Zipkin from Kafka</td>\n<td>高吞吐缓冲架构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>filelog</code></td>\n<td>N/A</td>\n<td>日志文件解析</td>\n<td>日志关联追踪</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>生产建议：只开启实际使用的 Receiver，关闭未用端口以减少攻击面。从 Tempo 2.7 开始，OTLP Receiver 默认绑定 <code>localhost</code> 而非 <code>0.0.0.0</code>，容器环境需显式配置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心-processor-详解\">核心 Processor 详解</h2><p>Processor 的执行顺序<strong>严格按 YAML 中的声明顺序</strong>，位置不同语义不同：</p>\n<h3 id=\"memory_limiter-内存保护\">memory_limiter（内存保护）</h3><p><strong>必须放在 Processor 链的最前面</strong>，防止 OOM：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"processors:&#10;  memory_limiter:&#10;    check_interval: 1s&#10;    limit_mib: 1500 # 硬限制&#10;    spike_limit_mib: 512 # 峰值缓冲\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">processors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  memory_limiter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    check_interval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    limit_mib</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1500</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 硬限制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    spike_limit_mib</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 峰值缓冲</span></span></code></pre></div><p>当内存逼近 <code>limit_mib - spike_limit_mib</code> 时开始拒绝新数据，达到 <code>limit_mib</code> 时强制 GC。</p>\n<h3 id=\"batch-批量聚合\">batch（批量聚合）</h3><p>将零散的 Span 聚合为批次，减少下游 RPC 次数：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>send_batch_size</code></td>\n<td>8192</td>\n<td>触发发送的批次大小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>send_batch_max_size</code></td>\n<td>0 (无限)</td>\n<td>单批最大 Span 数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>timeout</code></td>\n<td>200ms</td>\n<td>批次等待超时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"attributes-属性操作\">attributes（属性操作）</h3><p>在 Collector 层统一添加/修改/删除 Span Attributes：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"processors:&#10;  attributes:&#10;    actions:&#10;      - key: environment&#10;        value: production&#10;        action: upsert&#10;      - key: internal.debug_id&#10;        action: delete&#10;      - key: db.statement&#10;        action: hash # 脱敏：对 SQL 做哈希\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">processors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  attributes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    actions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">environment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">upsert</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">internal.debug_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">delete</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">db.statement</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">hash</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 脱敏：对 SQL 做哈希</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"filter-条件过滤\">filter（条件过滤）</h3><p>丢弃不需要的 Span，降低存储成本：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"processors:&#10;  filter:&#10;    error_mode: ignore&#10;    traces:&#10;      span:&#10;        - &#39;attributes[&quot;http.target&quot;] == &quot;/healthz&quot;&#39;&#10;        - &#39;attributes[&quot;http.target&quot;] == &quot;/readyz&quot;&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">processors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    error_mode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ignore</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    traces</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      span</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'attributes[\"http.target\"] == \"/healthz\"'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'attributes[\"http.target\"] == \"/readyz\"'</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"tail_sampling-尾采样\">tail_sampling（尾采样）</h3><p>基于完整 Trace 信息的智能采样（详见采样策略章节），需要 Load Balancing Exporter 配合保证同一 Trace 路由到同一实例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多管道与-connector\">多管道与 Connector</h2><p>一个 Collector 可以配置多条独立管道，甚至用 Connector 将管道串联：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"receivers:&#10;  otlp:&#10;    protocols:&#10;      grpc:&#10;        endpoint: 0.0.0.0:4317&#10;&#10;processors:&#10;  batch: {}&#10;  memory_limiter:&#10;    limit_mib: 2000&#10;    spike_limit_mib: 512&#10;&#10;exporters:&#10;  otlp/tempo:&#10;    endpoint: tempo:4317&#10;    tls:&#10;      insecure: true&#10;  otlp/datadog:&#10;    endpoint: intake.datadoghq.com:443&#10;&#10;connectors:&#10;  spanmetrics: # 从 Trace 生成 Metrics&#10;    dimensions:&#10;      - name: http.method&#10;      - name: http.status_code&#10;&#10;service:&#10;  pipelines:&#10;    traces/primary:&#10;      receivers: [otlp]&#10;      processors: [memory_limiter, batch]&#10;      exporters: [otlp/tempo, spanmetrics]&#10;    metrics/derived:&#10;      receivers: [spanmetrics]&#10;      processors: [batch]&#10;      exporters: [otlp/datadog]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">receivers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  otlp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    protocols</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      grpc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">0.0.0.0:4317</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">processors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  batch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  memory_limiter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    limit_mib</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    spike_limit_mib</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">exporters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  otlp/tempo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">tempo:4317</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    tls</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      insecure</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  otlp/datadog</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">intake.datadoghq.com:443</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">connectors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  spanmetrics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 从 Trace 生成 Metrics</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    dimensions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">http.method</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">http.status_code</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">service</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pipelines</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    traces/primary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      receivers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">otlp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      processors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">memory_limiter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">batch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      exporters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">otlp/tempo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">spanmetrics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    metrics/derived</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      receivers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">spanmetrics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      processors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">batch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      exporters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">otlp/datadog</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    SDK[&quot;OTel SDK&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;OTLP&quot;| RECV[&quot;otlp receiver&quot;]&#10;    RECV --&gt; ML[&quot;memory_limiter&quot;]&#10;    ML --&gt; BAT[&quot;batch&quot;]&#10;    BAT --&gt; TEMPO[&quot;otlp/tempo exporter&quot;]&#10;    BAT --&gt; SM[&quot;spanmetrics connector&quot;]&#10;    SM --&gt; BAT2[&quot;batch (metrics)&quot;]&#10;    BAT2 --&gt; DD[&quot;otlp/datadog exporter&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    SDK[\"OTel SDK\"] --&gt;|\"OTLP\"| RECV[\"otlp receiver\"]\n    RECV --&gt; ML[\"memory_limiter\"]\n    ML --&gt; BAT[\"batch\"]\n    BAT --&gt; TEMPO[\"otlp/tempo exporter\"]\n    BAT --&gt; SM[\"spanmetrics connector\"]\n    SM --&gt; BAT2[\"batch (metrics)\"]\n    BAT2 --&gt; DD[\"otlp/datadog exporter\"]</pre><h2 id=\"部署模式-agent-vs-gateway\">部署模式：Agent vs Gateway</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>部署方式</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Agent</td>\n<td>DaemonSet / Sidecar</td>\n<td>本地聚合、协议转换、初步过滤</td>\n<td>每个 Node/Pod</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gateway</td>\n<td>Deployment (2+ 副本)</td>\n<td>尾采样、路由分发、跨集群转发</td>\n<td>集群级中心化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>生产推荐：Agent + Gateway 两层架构。Agent 负责低延迟接收和简单处理，Gateway 负责需要全局视图的操作（尾采样、跨集群路由）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"load-balancing-exporter\">Load Balancing Exporter</h3><p>Gateway 层做尾采样时，必须确保同一 TraceID 的所有 Span 路由到同一个 Gateway 实例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"exporters:&#10;  loadbalancing:&#10;    protocol:&#10;      otlp:&#10;        tls:&#10;          insecure: true&#10;    resolver:&#10;      dns:&#10;        hostname: otel-gateway-headless&#10;        port: 4317&#10;    routing_key: traceID # 按 TraceID 一致性哈希\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">exporters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  loadbalancing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    protocol</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      otlp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        tls</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          insecure</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    resolver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      dns</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        hostname</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">otel-gateway-headless</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        port</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4317</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    routing_key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">traceID</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 按 TraceID 一致性哈希</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"高可用与容错\">高可用与容错</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>配置</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>重试</td>\n<td><code>retry_on_failure.enabled: true</code></td>\n<td>临时失败自动退避重试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>队列</td>\n<td><code>sending_queue.enabled: true</code></td>\n<td>内存/磁盘队列缓冲</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>持久化</td>\n<td><code>sending_queue.storage: file_storage</code></td>\n<td>重启不丢数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>背压</td>\n<td>Receiver 返回 429/503</td>\n<td>通知 SDK 降速</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Collector 的 Receiver-Processor-Exporter 管道模型是数据治理的核心</li>\n<li>memory_limiter 必须在 Processor 链首位防 OOM</li>\n<li>batch 和 filter 是成本控制的主要手段</li>\n<li>Connector 实现 Trace→Metrics 的派生，一份数据多种用途</li>\n<li>Agent + Gateway 两层架构兼顾低延迟和全局智能</li>\n<li>Load Balancing Exporter 是尾采样的前置必要条件</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"opentelemetry-sdk\">OpenTelemetry SDK 架构</a>：SDK 端的数据如何产生并发送到 Collector</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../service-mesh/operations/observability-integration\">服务网格中的可观测性集成</a>：Envoy 如何与 OTel Collector 协作收集追踪数据</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"OTel Collector 管道编排：Receiver-Processor-Exporter","id":"otel-collector-管道编排-receiver-processor-exporter"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"核心 Receiver 详解","id":"核心-receiver-详解"},{"level":2,"text":"核心 Processor 详解","id":"核心-processor-详解"},{"level":3,"text":"memory_limiter（内存保护）","id":"memory_limiter-内存保护"},{"level":3,"text":"batch（批量聚合）","id":"batch-批量聚合"},{"level":3,"text":"attributes（属性操作）","id":"attributes-属性操作"},{"level":3,"text":"filter（条件过滤）","id":"filter-条件过滤"},{"level":3,"text":"tail_sampling（尾采样）","id":"tail_sampling-尾采样"},{"level":2,"text":"多管道与 Connector","id":"多管道与-connector"},{"level":2,"text":"部署模式：Agent vs Gateway","id":"部署模式-agent-vs-gateway"},{"level":3,"text":"Load Balancing Exporter","id":"load-balancing-exporter"},{"level":2,"text":"高可用与容错","id":"高可用与容错"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"OpenTelemetry SDK 架构与生产配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-tracing/implementation/opentelemetry-sdk"},"next":{"title":"eBPF 零代码自动插桩","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-tracing/implementation/ebpf-auto-instrumentation"}}